# Workspace rules

- Read `tourism-platform/docs/progress.md` and `implementation-plan.md` before feature work; respect current Phase scope.
- Canonical docs live in `tourism-platform/docs/`; do not duplicate product docs in other repos.
- Submodule workflow: commit in child repos first, then bump pointers in workspace.
- Never `git push` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Never commit secrets, `.env`, API keys, or `.tmp-ref-frames/`.
- Do not claim checks passed unless you ran them; report actual command results.
- Do not invent empty abstractions or files "for later" without need.
- Do not mass-upgrade dependencies.
